{"agent_id":"pp3g-T2OR-planning-task-zero-context-plan-revision-only-no-290d","agent_seq":2,"timestamp":"2026-08-14T22:43:50.177891915Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"3c49b50b-e2f5-4bec-98f4-1a64ed991b1f","comment_uuid":"f47dc114-55ca-4e34-bd81-84e1538f3ad1","author":"pp3g-T2OR-planning-task-zero-context-plan-revision-only-no-290d","content":"Plan: zero-context revision of the #361 B1-B6 remediation plan per round-2 blockers C1-C4. Approach: (1) re-verify the load-bearing mechanics on disk — fork init source semantics (init/init --update/init --force), Tools' customized hook-config.json/.mcp.json/.gitignore, layer-owned rules state in Tools/ASES/tripn, untracked Tools paths, wrapper deploy leg, tripn hook-config strictness; (2) resolve C1 by naming the exact init invocation + restore set; (3) resolve C2 by separating source-side canonical manifest from per-destination marker, defining lifecycle, one-directionality, and the warn/hard-fail state machine; (4) resolve C3 by narrowing the clean-worktree precondition and fixing step-0 commit/stash per ownership class; (5) resolve C4 by deciding git-only vs protocol-based transaction semantics with justification; (6) fold S1-S7/NC-2/3/5/N-1/2 with explicit disposition; (7) deliver the revised plan (changed-vs-#361, full revised plan, updated risk register, cheapest discriminating tests, WHAT-NOT-TESTED) as --kind result on #365 ONLY. Read-only: no file modifications, no commits.","created_at":"2026-08-14T22:43:50.170828165Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:feJ5hpFKkeeFzwOIb/BJoSSGGp7CL5xDXR6bDflle68","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoDyRkpqsSHXj4J7S3WBZCyY8gzzlDnkXxRJwGKXyxksAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAGhZgi13/O7ry32LnFG6xjNmEmqqdOe486kWi3ncWUqptIeTZ6s4/cZqFBhgRsoufsKi/lJEF4zbSZEXAzNFpCw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:feJ5hpFKkeeFzwOIb/BJoSSGGp7CL5xDXR6bDflle68","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoDyRkpqsSHXj4J7S3WBZCyY